        "Visual Studio Code Remote Development: Open any folder in WSL, in a Docker container, or on a remote machine using SSH and take advantage of VS Code's full feature set.": "Visual Studio Code Remote Development: открывайте любую папку в WSL, контейнере Docker или на удалённой машине по SSH и используйте все возможности VS Code.",
        "Visual Studio Code extension for SailPoint Identity Security Cloud": "Расширение Visual Studio Code для SailPoint Identity Security Cloud",
